/* Written  3:54 pm  May 15, 1985 by pbear!peterb in pbear:net.games.hack */
/* ---------- "Hack for PC/IX available!!" ---------- */

	I hacked up the sources for pdp 11 hack and got it to run under
	PC/IX. The text is almost full, and one bug(limitation) still
	exists. If you get deep enought mklev adds lots of objects and
	monsters, and hack runs out of data space.

	I have the sources available for those who want it. This version
	will only run under pc/ix since it uses some assembler to speed
	things up a bit.

	I am coding some of the slower parts in assembler in order to speed
	up the code. So after you get the distrubution, I will be sending
	out updates as I make the changes. So please include a complete
	path and name so I can keep track of the sites who have it,
	thereby making updates and bug reports simpler to send out.

	If you have any ideas for changes/additions, please mail me and if
	they look good I'll add them in. (if it fits. Right now there are
	only 245 free bytes in the text segment).


	Thanx,

	Peter Barada
